TruckCraft
Rust remodel of TS SE Tool.
Original project: https://github.com/LIPtoH/TS-SE-Tool
Community project: https://github.com/chrissts/TruckCraft

The original project's Apache-2.0 license and attribution are retained.
The remodel was developed with the original C# application, its
community changes, and third-party decoder source available as references.
This repository contains the Rust implementation and starts without imported
Git history.

scs-codec adapts Wilps93/scs_tools at commit
e147e755778579e78f80a406a53c64515113d7a1.
See crates/scs-codec/LICENSE, UPSTREAM-NOTICES.md and licenses/ for the
applicable MIT, Apache-2.0 and algorithm/documentation provenance notices.
Other dependencies retain their respective licenses, recorded by Cargo.lock.
Binary distributions include these license records in the licenses folder.

Euro Truck Simulator 2 and American Truck Simulator names and logos are
SCS Software assets, used to identify the games. They are not licensed under
the application source license. Game skill artwork, stock portraits and company
logos bundled in private builds likewise retain SCS Software attribution. See
crates/desktop/assets/ARTWORK.md and crates/desktop/assets/game/ASSET-SOURCES.json
for their provenance.
TruckCraft is not affiliated with or endorsed by SCS Software.
